        <mxCell id="c60" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;fillColor=#fffaf3;strokeColor=#d79b00;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Footnotes: B. Claude Projects&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; There is one coordinator per project, and each project belongs to one user. Public beta on Pro, Max and Ultra plans (not yet Team or Enterprise), in claude.ai/code, the desktop app and mobile apps, not the CLI, VSC or JetBrains. Usage is heavier than a single session.&lt;br&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; The coordinator sees what threads report back, not every step they take. Approvals happen inside each thread; a chat message to the coordinator doesn&#39;t answer a waiting thread.&lt;br&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Cloud threads work on &lt;b&gt;github.com repos only&lt;/b&gt;, with the Claude GitHub App installed; ADO, GitLab and Bitbucket aren&#39;t supported. They inherit the project instructions, project memory, and each repo&#39;s CLAUDE.md files, rules and skills. They do &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; load &lt;code&gt;.mcp.json&lt;/code&gt;, hooks, permission rules or env settings, so they get &lt;b&gt;no Fabric MCP&lt;/b&gt;. They keep running with the laptop closed. Uncommitted sandbox work can be lost.&lt;br&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Local threads need the folder connected through Remote Control (Settings › Code). They run in &lt;b&gt;auto mode&lt;/b&gt; and use the folder itself by default. They get the project instructions but not the project memory. Two threads in one folder can overwrite each other&#39;s changes. They pause while the PC sleeps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; Threads can use subagents for their own side tasks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; local Code-tab sessions stay outside Projects. Projects add a new option; they don&#39;t replace local sessions." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="780" x="880" y="568" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c61" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size:17px&#39;&gt;C. Side-by-side comparison&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1620" x="40" y="850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c62" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;overflow=fill;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;table style=&#39;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px&#39;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style=&#39;border:1px solid #999;padding:6px;background:#e6e6e6;text-align:left&#39;&gt;Level&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&#39;border:1px solid #999;padding:6px;background:#dae8fc;text-align:left&#39;&gt;A. Local code-first (your Fabric workflow)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style=&#39;border:1px solid #999;padding:6px;background:#ffe6cc;text-align:left&#39;&gt;B. Projects (new, beta)&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Top container&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Repo folder, e.g. NYC_VehicleCrashes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Project, e.g. &amp;quot;Fabric&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;DP-600&amp;quot;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Repo files, CLAUDE.md file, rules, skills, folder memory, .mcp.json file&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Project instructions, project memory, the repo&amp;#x27;s CLAUDE.md files, rules and skills (no .mcp.json, hooks or permission rules)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Coordinator&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;You (a session can propose or start sibling sessions, with your approval)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Coordinator conversation (sees thread reports, not every step)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Worker unit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Session: a full Claude Code session you start and steer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Thread: a full Claude Code session the coordinator starts; you can open and steer it&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Where workers run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Your PC: the repo folder or its own worktree&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Cloud sandbox (default), or a local connected folder&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Isolation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Optional git worktree&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Cloud: a fresh branch per thread. Local: the folder by default, Worktree toggle optional&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Permission mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Your choice per session&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Threads usually run in auto mode; any prompt waits inside its thread&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Helpers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Subagents, reporting to their session&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Subagents, reporting to their thread (coordinator: unconfirmed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tools available&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Fabric MCP, Git, PBID files, VSC&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Cloud: GitHub and claude.ai connectors only. Local: your machine&amp;#x27;s tools&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Repo host&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;ADO (any host works)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;github.com only (no ADO)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delivery path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Branch → commit → push to ADO → pull request → Fabric workspace sync&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;Branch → pull request on GitHub (auto-fix watches CI)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Runs with laptop closed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;No&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#f7f7f7&#39;&gt;Cloud threads, yes&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Where available&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;CLI, desktop app, VSC, JetBrains&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&#39;border:1px solid #bbb;padding:6px;vertical-align:top;background:#ffffff&#39;&gt;claude.ai/code, desktop app, mobile&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="385" width="1620" x="40" y="885" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c63" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;i&gt;The two are separate. Local sessions stay outside Projects unless you move one in with &lt;b&gt;Continue in project&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="26" width="1620" x="40" y="1280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c64" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2e0;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;dashed=1;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;Project instructions + memory&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;font-size:11px&#39;&gt;shared context for threads&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="46" width="200" x="890" y="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c65" edge="1" parent="1" source="c64" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=none;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" target="c37" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c66" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" value="&lt;i&gt;A local thread can follow path A instead (ADO → Fabric workspace sync).&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="22" width="760" x="890" y="541" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
